"""
RoomToFP v9 inference script.

Purpose:
- Run the v9 RoomToFP model on either a v9 .npz sample or a raw Structured3D scene folder
- Use the v9 10-channel BEV input
- Prefer the v9 dense boundary128_xy output for room polygons
- Save clean SVG, PNG, JSON and dense mask previews
- Keep post-processing intentionally light because v9 should first be evaluated model-first

